tatus", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 837762, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01W4b9BPGGng8pRBD82AWA8x", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 839809, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_0162qGEsB97weMkz3rHc9MoK", "tool": "list_deployments", "args": {"service": "payments-worker", "confidence": 0.85}, "confidence": 0.85}, {"t_ms": 840109, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_0162qGEsB97weMkz3rHc9MoK", "tool": "list_deployments", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 840109, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0162qGEsB97weMkz3rHc9MoK", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 853504, "event": "escalation", "actor": "control_plane", "id": "esc5", "kind": "clarification", "trigger": "principal_reply", "tool": null, "args": null, "question": "I haven't rolled anything back or opened the incident yet. Two payments services are failing, and I can't tell which one was deployed this morning.\n\n**What I checked:**\n- There's no service called just `payments`. Two payments services exist, and both have the same error rate in all three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west):\n\n| Service | Current version | Health | Error rate | Last healthy release in production |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `payments-api` | v5.1.0 | degraded | 18% | v5.0.0 |\n| `payments-worker` | v3.4.0 | unhealthy | 18% | v3.3.0 |\n\n- The release history has no timestamps, so I can't tell which release was this morning's.\n- There are no open incidents right now.\n\n**Why I stopped:** You asked me to roll back one service. Rolling back the wrong one would change production without fixing the problem, so I'd rather check with you first. Both rollbacks would go to versions that were healthy in production, so neither needs change-manager approval.\n\n**Which should I do?**\n1. Roll back `payments-api` to v5.0.0\n2. Roll back `payments-worker` to v3.3.0\n3. Roll back both, since both are failing\n\nOnce you choose, I'll do the rollback and open the SEV2 incident for that service straight away. If you want the incident opened now, I can do that first and note that the root cause isn't confirmed yet.", "context": {}}, {"t_ms": 964519, "event": "human_response", "actor": "human", "escalation": "esc5", "decision": "answer", "message": "It's payments-worker - the API errors are downstream of the worker.", "latency_ms": 111015, "hint": {"service": "payments-worker"}, "erred": false}, {"t_ms": 964519, "event": "principal_reply", "actor": "human", "text": "It's payments-worker - the API errors are downstream of the worker."}, {"t_ms": 968989, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01PYLtH3BYocEbZ9NhiyLcsx", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "payments-worker", "version": "v3.3.0", "confidence": 0.93}, "confidence": 0.93}, {"t_ms": 972989, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01PYLtH3BYocEbZ9NhiyLcsx", "tool": "rollback", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 972989, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01PYLtH3BYocEbZ9NhiyLcsx", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 972989, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01MHkeVtnAft1tXioyA33nC4", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "payments-worker errors after v3.4.0 deploy; rolled back to v3.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "payments-worker", "summary": "payments-worker v3.4.0 (this morning's deploy) went unhealthy with an 18% error rate in us-east, us-west and eu-west. payments-api (v5.1.0, degraded, 18% errors) is failing downstream of the worker. We are rolling payments-worker back to v3.3.0, its last release that was healthy in production. Next: confirm that the worker and API error rates recover after the rollback.", "idempotency_key": "payments-worker-v3.4.0-rollback-sev2", "confidence": 0.92}, "confidence": 0.92}, {"t_ms": 973589, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01MHkeVtnAft1tXioyA33nC4", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "payments-worker-v3.4.0-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 973589, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01MHkeVtnAft1tXioyA33nC4", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 975735, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_012feAZMTraSEqaW2d8ddfAY", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "payments-worker", "confidence": 0.9}, "confidence": 0.9}, {"t_ms": 976035, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_012feAZMTraSEqaW2d8ddfAY", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 976035, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_012feAZMTraSEqaW2d8ddfAY", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 976035, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_018NfsRBssTnJqJsGPpRUv7w", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "payments-api", "confidence": 0.9}, "confidence": 0.9}, {"t_ms": 976335, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_018NfsRBssTnJqJsGPpRUv7w", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, 